    expect(sympyStr(integrate(new Pow(new Add([new Mul([rational(144), new Pow(fn('cos', [x]), rational(2)), new Pow(fn('sin', [x]), rational(4))]), new Mul([rational(144), new Pow(fn('cos', [x]), rational(4)), new Pow(fn('sin', [x]), rational(2))])]), rational(1, 2)), x, [rational(0), new Mul([rational(1, 6), pi])], { conds: 'piecewise' }))).toBe('3/2');
